OL,5,G1730 Live: NFL on 5: Kansas City Chiefs
OL,6,G     @ Atlanta Falcons
OL,7,     FJoin Sam, Osi and Efe as they
OL,8,     Fbring all of the action from the
OL,9,     FMercedes-Benz Stadium in Atlanta,
OL,10,     Fthe home of the high-powered, but
OL,11,     Ffaltering, Falcons offense.
OL,12,G2100 Cops
OL,13,     FA man in possession of a stolen
OL,14,     Fcar explains his unique nickname
OL,15,     Fto deputies. Police go to the same
OL,16,     Fhouse twice in less than 30
OL,17,     Fminutes to sort out a messy
OL,18,     Fmarital spat.
